    "body": "### Backfilled observation (found during a later detect-flaky-ci scan)\n\n- Run: https://github.com/growilabs/growi/actions/runs/33073692980\n- Job: ci-app-test-integration (24.x, 8.0, 9, 9.3.3)\n- Commit: 081016bfc887b6aa7449afef959d2639adba3904\n- Date: 2026-08-27T13:02:00Z\n- Predates fix: this commit (2026-08-27T12:49:09Z) is earlier than https://github.com/growilabs/growi/pull/11828's merge (2026-08-28T21:37:26Z); not reopened.\n\n```\nFAIL app-integration src/server/service/page/v5.non-public-page.integ.ts > PageService page operations with non-public pages\nError: Hook timed out in 10000ms.\n \u276f src/server/service/page/v5.non-public-page.integ.ts:181:3\n   beforeAll(async () => {\n     crowi = await getInstance();\n```\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
